-denops/denops.vim/pull/52|#52 Add `checkhealth`\u003e","text":"*About*\n\nIt provides supports for Neovim's `:checkhealth` command (and Vim's one, with \u003chttps://github.com/rhysd/vim-healthcheck|rhysd/vim-healthcheck\u003e ).\n\n*new features*\n\n• add `g:denops#version`\n• handle `checkhealth`\n    • check if `deno` is callable from `denops` and check its version.\n    • check `denops#server` is running.\n    • check Vim/Neovim version.\n\n*Remaining issues*\n\n• Write docs(README, doc, wiki)\n• We may need to determine minimum and recommended version of Vim/Neovim/Deno.\n• Some of functions in `health/denops.vim` may be duplicated with `plugin.vim` after #51 is resolved. If you feel it redundant, please merge and move declarations into any other files.","fields":[{"title":"Assignees","value":"kkiyama117","short":true},{"title":"Labels","value":"enhancement","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1624202947}],"edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1624255334.000000"},"reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"bow","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"sumi","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a6yKU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78ddc36c-f52a-419c-9946-65fedae8f305","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まだしばらくかかります（土日しかほとんど動けないので）","ts":"1624255181.348600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YrYba"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dfdb5a0-a96f-4ce7-8cad-a76e5e0fbd16","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"おっ","ts":"1624255128.348000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WKV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59122959-9260-45f5-9e95-61ff1011ffed","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/53\u003e","ts":"1624254807.347700","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/53|#53 :boom:  Breaking changes for next major release\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/53|#53 :boom:  Breaking changes for next major release\u003e","text":"☑︎ Change Workerio protocol from `number[]` to `Uint8Array` for performance improvement (workerio)\n☑︎ Support `close()` on sessions (msgpack_rpc/vim_channel_command)\n☐ Plugins should depend on types of `denops_core` rather than implementations so that we can check if plugins work on the current working `denops_core`\n☐ Prefer functional styles rather than object orientational styles so that 3rd party modules can provides quite similar APIs of official one","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1624254790}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VCxj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a18f2f85-d60a-4e3b-afb3-2b50fdb662b8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"coc や VSCode とかはめっちゃたくさん I/F 出してますからね。（便利モジュールたくさんコミコミなのでしょうがないですが）","ts":"1624254230.347500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f/cRp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff1295bc-dc6f-43d8-a321-bcce4ebb3165","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そこでいきなりAPI潰したりしない限りは壊れないっていうのが理想な感じある","ts":"1624254213.347000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9dD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1CE0011C-EB6E-48B5-AA41-CAD657BC5D44","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"最高感","ts":"1624254198.346500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false