ginal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cLthD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"931DB569-BC67-427A-AF3F-8212D263C663","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"いえ、大工事なのは「やる」なんですが、動的ロードって結構遅かったんですよね","ts":"1624253708.336400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+8Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"531f22d0-33f8-4619-a7c4-e5311308bf53","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"大工事すぎるか。。。","ts":"1624253673.335300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k2d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2413064C-4CBF-43F4-A887-DB95578C12E8","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"やはりダイナミック","ts":"1624253657.335100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NKM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ff63bcc-7832-4e77-813d-593364274e0f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"denops_core が各種プラグインのファイルパスを手に入れて、Worker を作る際に `loader.ts?import=%PLUGIN_PATH%` で渡して、loader.ts が内部的に dynamic import というイメージです。","ts":"1624253643.334900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B9ZfQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6E436697-F592-4F4C-9481-7A4DDD29B300","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"それか動的ロードか","ts":"1624253620.333900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VjjD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35CB6182-B84A-4634-8508-6FF7BFFC8A74","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"起動スクリプトの動的生成くらいしか思いつかない","ts":"1624253549.332900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l9eK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06F321ED-58E9-4EAC-9467-3B6C613D8CE5","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なんとか「自分」をworkerに渡せると良いんですが難易度","ts":"1624253525.332200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"skh1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9c8a64c-fd05-4fa9-8f02-717f32ff1d06","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```export const main = async (ctx) =\u0026gt; {\n  await std.bufexists(ctx);\n};```\nとかになるかもしれない。このへんはありすえさんの意思決定次第ではありますね。","ts":"1624253411.330800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0/i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a3e94dd-06ee-409e-bb13-1274dfdba3f0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あと全部関数形式にしよう。みたいな議論もあったので","ts":"1624253363.329600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i9S="}]},{"client_msg_id":"250365f4-d5f3-44a3-bf91-71af1e9de9d7","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"std は context を受け取って便利な機能を実現する。という部分を受け持ちます。今とおそらくあまり変わらないかな。","ts":"1624253271.328200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01D44KSY9Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NDuzO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66133372-d05b-4f3e-8b23-aa17fbde87c4","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"今どうなってるのか分かってないのでアレですが","ts":"1624253264.328000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yLK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9fddec2-311c-4cd1-a4d4-1ba0d4543a20","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そうなるとstdは処理の実態を持たなくなる？","ts":"1624253245.327400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cVNM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"108689a9-71ec-4c48-94a5-e77d96692ca6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```export const main = async ({ context }) =\u0026gt; {\n  const vim = std.vim(context);\n};```\nこんな感じでもいけますね。","ts":"1624253224.327300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Ms"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a78b774-f337-4eb3-b5fa-51cbfda5185b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"denops_std が main を提供してるみたいなやつはやめないといけなくなってしまいますが。","ts":"1624253192.325900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ne6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e9e0580-4f46-483e-8c49-1231d68eee1d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"`main` 関数を各種プラグインから手に入れて、Worker に包んで実行する。というところまで denops_core がやることになる。","ts":"1624253160.325500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L4l+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fe5dc69-a45b-4074-a5bd-afd22e325b3e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"型定義を別途公開しておいて、それをimportしたものをexportさせた上でdenops側はdynamic importするとか","ts":"1624253158.325400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fcq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b963a9a6-e13c-4cf2-b84d-91cdd920b882","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"main を露出させる方法だと、少なくとも `vim` の実態をコードとして持つのは denops_core 側になって、プラグイン側は vim を受け取って実行する形になるので","ts":"1624253134.324300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3F+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BF39CA26-5629-452B-862B-8CDA3AEFC012","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Worker用のスクリプトを自動生成かな？","ts":"1624253115.323600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"obT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19828B98-ECC1-4D0C-A903-F4083302CA00","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"mainを露出して上手くやるっての、出来るかな","ts":"1624253086.322600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1hIy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6833a1e-ccca-44ee-8fe7-847c82fe5a2f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちょうどバージョンネゴシエーション問題なblogを見てて、大変だよなあって思ってたところだった\n(TLS/HTTP/NTP...)","ts":"1624253059.322100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fwN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f25e2917-89a4-4760-bc39-2acc6898b4e3","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"coc が型だけ露出させるようにしたのもおそらくそういう経緯だろう。","ts":"1624253040.321400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zElac"}]},{"client_msg_id":"412b46b9-b0e6-441b-a37e-b09e36d99b4b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"最悪気付かないで壊れてるリポジトリがあったらそっとIssueかPR出すとか……","ts":"1624253026.320900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j4E+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EAC332E4-0415-4469-833F-1B8C09D68933","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ですね。壊すこと自体は「やる」んですが、この先の対応が","ts":"1624253007.320400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VoU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a04e5898-01ae-4b17-ba12-2f3526d11173","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらく、プラグイン側に denops の実行コードがバンドルされない形にしたら依存切れる気がするがどうなんだろう。","ts":"1624252997.320000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"puS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b10f5e8-09fc-423c-a6fd-6df4766eb2bf","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"現状ほとんどのプラグインがここ発ですよね？","ts":"1624252969.318500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7tPl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97f1d2b7-3f26-4960-b1d6-9fd1d154e8c3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"その方向で考えてます","ts":"1624257114.384700","thread_ts":"1624257010.383600","parent_user_id":"U8R597E9H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x7F2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1f3cbfa-4916-4df1-9af0-ddd1777dd74a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"すいません。言っておいてあれですが、このイベントすらも隠蔽したほうがいいかもしれない。と思い