":"rich_text","block_id":"TR6hB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"967f4d33-9d7e-458a-9d15-606fbc8c35fc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"まだぎりぎり互換性壊しても許されるタイミングだと思ってる","ts":"1624252953.317900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PkQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"303a4efa-2e7e-40d3-8698-c8ec9b817b3c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"プラグイン側は `export const main = async (vim) =\u0026gt; {}` を露出させるようにして、denops 側でハンドリングするとかかなあ。","ts":"1624252940.317300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e6eS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2474dca1-24b7-401d-8970-6be4383d3e72","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"プラグイン側が `main()` を呼ぶのではなくて","ts":"1624252918.316500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"clS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0dc6fcc-63fb-47cf-96a4-c11d4831692a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あ、してるわ。","ts":"1624252906.316000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Jl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d98da264-3074-4f79-9090-fe85f4e3bee9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"実際、依存してない気がするんですよね。","ts":"1624252896.315500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BeNwS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e289b3c-e7fd-4057-8d43-4f2c9c418ddb","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あとは内部実装には依存しないように工夫してモジュールを分けてプラグインを作れるようにするとかか。","ts":"1624252878.315100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uGr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8C764D7F-77EE-4CF1-81FB-E0F70654068B","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なんかうまくできないかなーと考えてますが、厳しそうですよね","ts":"1624252857.314700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":fa